# Line endings (Phase 0, 2026-07-27)
# The repo had no line-ending policy, so a Windows working tree produced
# ~44,600 `prettier/prettier` "Delete ␍" warnings. That volume drowned real
# lint signal. Normalise to LF in the repository; Git still checks out the
# platform-native ending locally.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.pdf binary
